  "description": "It’s not tariffs making you pay more — it’s corporate spin",
  "body_html": "<p>“Prices are going up because of Tariffs!”. I’m sorry, but about 80% of the time, it is bullshit. Excuse my language. The worst I have heard is “anticipatory tariffs”….where the tariffs haven’t even hit, yet the company still raises prices in anticipation. What a bogus story. </p><p>What can you do? Obviously, you can’t fight Walmart or Home Depot…but you can often find alternatives. At smaller companies, ask them to show you why the price went up? If its a raw commodity (like coffee!) you can often retort back. Check out FB Market Place to see if there is a substitute or even the same product for less. Will you save on everything? No. But by questioning some of these “tariff price hikes” you will often save yourself some money. </p><p><em>For more visit: <strong><a href=\"https://www.stocktokdashboard.com/\">StockTokDashboard</a></strong></em> <em><strong>|</strong> <strong><a href=\"https://substack.com/chat/3537822\">Chat with Timothy</a></strong></em> <em><strong>| <a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/\">All Publications</a></strong></em></p><div class=\"captioned-button-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-weekly-wrap-up-822?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_content=share&amp;action=share&amp;token=eyJ1c2VyX2lkIjozMDEwNTIzMjUsInBvc3RfaWQiOjE3MTY1NTcwMCwiaWF0IjoxNzU2MTQ2MDYxLCJleHAiOjE3NTg3MzgwNjEsImlzcyI6InB1Yi0zNTM3ODIyIiwic3ViIjoicG9zdC1yZWFjdGlvbiJ9.Dy1ckHX5d6yCVwBd130HXA_5sXvfIVHuUcvkDNfFxRc&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CaptionedButtonToDOM\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">If you like StockTok’s analysis and commentary, share it with someone you like. Heck, share it with people you don’t like to!</p></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/no-tariffs-just-greed?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/no-tariffs-just-greed?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p></div><p><em>Subscribers get direct access with me Monday to Friday during market hours in the chat, stock reviews and access to our StockTok Dashboard, updated daily. <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe\">Subscribe Now.</a> </strong></em></p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/no-tariffs-just-greed/comments&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Leave a comment&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/no-tariffs-just-greed/comments\"><span>Leave a comment</span></a></p>",
